    'Make Wistudi your own':'让 Wistudi 真正适合你的机构','Your people, content, permissions and learning structure.':'你的人员、内容、权限和学习结构。','Organisation control is not just a layer around learning. It is what makes the learning environment usable across real teams, cohorts and programmes.':'机构管理不仅是学习之外的一层设置，它让学习环境能够真正应用于团队、cohort 和项目。','Branding':'品牌','Shape the organisation experience around your identity.':'围绕你的品牌身份打造机构体验。','Teams':'团队','Admins, publishers, educators, trainers and learners.':'管理员、发布者、教育者、培训师和学习者。','Permissions':'权限','Control who can create, publish, access and manage.':'控制谁可以创建、发布、访问和管理。','Private content':'私有内容','Keep organisation learning private where required.':'需要时保持机构学习内容私有。','Content libraries':'内容库','Build reusable resources, curricula and training libraries.':'构建可复用资源、课程体系和培训内容库。','Learner groups':'学习者群组','Organise classes, departments, cohorts or clients.':'组织班级、部门、cohort 或客户。','One organisation layer. Multiple learning experiences.':'一套机构管理结构，多种学习体验。','Keep the operational structure consistent even as teams use different formats and programmes.':'即使不同团队使用不同形式和项目，也能保持一致的运营结构。','People & groups':'人员与群组','Manage':'管理','Content & libraries':'内容与内容库','Organise':'组织','Publishing & permissions':'发布与权限','Control':'控制','Learning & results':'学习与结果','Track':'跟踪','Integrations & access':'集成与访问','Connect':'连接',
